opulation less than 25,000. Although the U.S. Department of Education does not operate the E-Rate program, it serves many of the same schools and school districts that participate in E-Rate, so the E-Rate locales are included here to facilitate research. Additional information about the E-Rate program is available at www.usac.org/sl.\",\r\n      \"keyword\": [\"E-Rate\",\"Urban\",\"Rural\"],\r\n      \"modified\": \"2017-06-28\",\r\n      \"publisher\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"org:Organization\",\r\n        \"name\": \"National Center for Education Statistics\",\r\n        \"subOrganizationOf\": {\r\n          \"@type\": \"org:Organization\",\r\n          \"name\": \"Institute of Education Sciences\",\r\n          \"subOrganizationOf\": {\r\n            \"@type\": \"org:Organization\",\r\n            \"name\": \"U.S. Department of Education\",\r\n            \"subOrganizationOf\": {\r\n              \"@type\": \"org:Organization\",\r\n              \"name\": \"U.S. Government\"\r\n            }\r\n          }\r\n        }\r\n      },\r\n      \"contactPoint\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"vcard:Contact\",\r\n        \"fn\": \"Doug Geverdt\",\r\n        \"hasEmail\": \"mailto:douglas.geverdt@ed.gov\"\r\n      },\r\n      \"identifier\": \"NCES_20141002\",\r\n      \"accessLevel\": \"public\",\r\n      \"bureauCode\": [ \"018:50\" ],\r\n      \"programCode\": [ \"018:000\" ],\r\n      \"license\": \"https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/\",\r\n      \"spatial\": \"United States\",\r\n      \"temporal\": \"2014/2014\",\r\n      \"distribution\": [\r\n        {\r\n          \"@type\": \"dcat:Distribution\",\r\n          \"description\": \"2014 E-Rate Locale Boundaries in shapefile format.\",\r\n          \"downloadURL\": \"https://nces.ed.gov/programs/edge/data/EDGE_LOCALE14_ERATE_US.zip\",\r\n          \"format\": \"Zipped File\",\r\n          \"mediaType\": \"application/zip\",\r\n          \"title\": \"2014 EDGE Locale Boundaries: E-Rate Locales\"\r\n        }\r\n      ],\r\n      \"dataQuality\": true,\r\n      \"language\": [ \"en-US\" ],\r\n      \"landingPage\": \"https://nces.ed.gov/programs/edge/geographicLocale.aspx\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"@type\": \"dcat:Dataset\",\r\n      \"title\": \"Zip Code Tabulation Areas Locale Assignments\",\r\n      \"description\": \"The ZCTA locale file is a table of NCES locale assignments applied to the Zip Code Tabulation Areas (ZCTAs) included in the Census Bureau’s TIGER/Line boundaries. It provides a way to assign NCES locale indicators to files that include a ZIP Code but do not include other street-level address information needed to make an assignment based on point location. ZCTAs are approximations of U.S. Postal Service (USPS) 5-digit ZIP Code service areas that the Census Bureau creates using census blocks to present statistical data from censuses and surveys. The ZCTA locale assignments are based on NCES locale boundaries and reflect the locale that accounts for the largest areal proportion of the ZCTA.\",\r\n      \"keyword\": [\"Zip Code\",\"Census Bureau\",\"Locale\",\"Urban\",\"Rural\"],\r\n      \"modified\": \"2017-06-28\",\r\n      \"publisher\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"org:Organization\",\r\n        \"name\": \"National Center for Education Statistics\",\r\n        \"subOrganizationOf\": {\r\n          \"@type\": \"org:Organization\",\r\n          \"name\": \"Institute of Education Sciences\",\r\n          \"subOrganizationOf\": {\r\n            \"@type\": \"org:Organization\",\r\n            \"name\": \"U.S. Department of Education\",\r\n            \"subOrganizationOf\": {\r\n              \"@type\": \"org:Organization\",\r\n              \"name\": \"U.S. Government\"\r\n            }\r\n          }\r\n        }\r\n      },\r\n      \"contactPoint\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"vcard:Contact\",\r\n        \"fn\": \"Doug Geverdt\",\r\n        \"hasEmail\": \"mailto:douglas.geverdt@ed.gov\"\r\n      },\r\n      \"identifier\": \"NCES_20141001\",\r\n      \"accessLevel\": \"public\",\r\n      \"bureauCode\": [ \"018:50\" ],\r\n      \"programCode\": [ \"018:000\" ],\r\n      \"license\": \"https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/\",\r\n      \"spatial\": \"United States\",\r\n      \"temporal\": \"2014/2014\",\r\n      \"distribution\": [\r\n        {\r\n          \"@type\": \"dcat:Distribution\",\r\n          \"description\": \"2014 ZCTA Locale Table Boundaries in DBF format.\",\r\n          \"downloadURL\": \"https://nces.ed.gov/programs/edge/data/EDGE_LOCALE14_ZCTA_TABLE.zip\",\r\n          \"format\": \"Zipped File\",\r\n          \"mediaType\": \"application/zip\",\r\n          \"title\": \"2014 EDGE Locale Boundaries: ZCTA Locale Table\"\r\n        }\r\n      ],\r\n      \"accrualPeriodicity\": \"R/P1Y\",\r\n      \"dataQuality\": true,\r\n      \"language\": [ \"en-US\" ],\r\n      \"landingPage\": \"https://nces.ed.gov/programs/edge/geographicZCTA.aspx\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"@type\": \"dcat:Dataset\",\r\n      \"title\": \"Equity in Athletics Disclosure Act Survey, 2013\",\r\n      \"description\": \"The Equity in Athletics Disclosure Act Survey, 2013 (EADA 2013), is part of the Equity in Athletics Disclosure Act Survey (EADA) program (https://www2.ed.gov/finaid/prof/resources/athletics/eada.html). Data is available since 2003 at <https://ope.ed.gov/athletics/>. The Equity in Athletics Disclosure Act requires co-educational institutions of postsecondary education that participate in a Title IV, federal student financial assistance program, and have an intercollegiate athletic program, to prepare an annual report to the Department of Education on athletic participation, staffing, and revenues and expenses, by men's and women's teams. This cross-sectional data collection was administered via an online survey. In 2013, the collection's response rate was 100 percent. Key statistics from EADA 2013 were designed to make prospective students aware of a schools� commitment to providing equitable athletic opportunities for its men and women students; as well, results were used in the Department's report to Congress on gender equity in intercollegiate athletics.\",\r\n      \"keyword\": [ \"Equity in Athletics Disclosure Act\", \"EADA\", \"Athletics\", \"Equitable athletic opportunities\", \"Postsecondary institutions\", \"Coaches\", \"Salaries\", \"Expenses\", \"Students\", \"Team\", \"Survey\", \"Report\", \"Participation rates\", \"Financial support data\", \"Higher Education Act\", \"Federal student financial assistance programs\", \"Intercollegiate Athletic program\", \"Athletic participation\", \"Staffing\", \"Revenue\", \"Expenditures by gender\", \"Expenditures by men's and women's teams\" ],\r\n      \"modified\": \"2015-03-16\",\r\n      \"publisher\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"org:Organization\",\r\n        \"name\": \"Office of Postsecondary Education\",\r\n        \"subOrganizationOf\": {\r\n          \"@type\": \"org:Organization\",\r\n          \"name\": \"U.S. Department of Education\",\r\n          \"subOrganizationOf\": {\r\n            \"@type\": \"org:Organization\",\r\n            \"name\": \"U.S. Government\"\r\n          }\r\n        }\r\n      },\r\n      \"contactPoint\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"vcard:Contact\",\r\n        \"fn\": \"Ashley Higgins\",\r\n        \"hasEmail\": \"mailto:ashley.higgins@ed.gov\"\r\n      },\r\n      \"identifier\": \"OPE_2013001\",\r\n      \"accessLevel\": \"public\",\r\n      \"bureauCode\": [ \"018:40\" ],\r\n      \"programCode\": [ \"018:000\" ],\r\n      \"license\": \"https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/\",\r\n      \"spatial\": \"United States\",\r\n      \"temporal\": \"2013/P1Y\",\r\n      \"distribution\": [\r\n        {\r\n          \"@type\": \"dcat:Distribution\",\r\n          \"description\": \"Data for academic year 2012-13\",\r\n          \"accessURL\": \"https://ope.ed.gov/athletics/#/datafile/list\"\r\n        }\r\n      ],\r\n      \"accrualPeriodicity\": \"R/P1Y\",\r\