e physical activity among elementary students; and the physical assessment of students.\",\r\n      \"keyword\": [ \"Elementary schools\", \"Physical education\", \"Nutrition\", \"Fast Response Survey System\", \"FRSS\" ],\r\n      \"modified\": \"2007-01-04\",\r\n      \"publisher\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"org:Organization\",\r\n        \"name\": \"National Center for Education Statistics\",\r\n        \"subOrganizationOf\": {\r\n          \"@type\": \"org:Organization\",\r\n          \"name\": \"Institute of Education Sciences\",\r\n          \"subOrganizationOf\": {\r\n            \"@type\": \"org:Organization\",\r\n            \"name\": \"U.S. Department of Education\",\r\n            \"subOrganizationOf\": {\r\n              \"@type\": \"org:Organization\",\r\n              \"name\": \"U.S. Government\"\r\n            }\r\n          }\r\n        }\r\n      },\r\n      \"contactPoint\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"vcard:Contact\",\r\n        \"fn\": \"John Ralph\",\r\n        \"hasEmail\": \"mailto:john.ralph@ed.gov\"\r\n      },\r\n      \"identifier\": \"NCES_2006057\",\r\n      \"accessLevel\": \"public\",\r\n      \"bureauCode\": [ \"018:50\" ],\r\n      \"programCode\": [ \"018:000\" ],\r\n      \"license\": \"https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/\",\r\n      \"spatial\": \"United States\",\r\n      \"temporal\": \"2004/2005\",\r\n      \"distribution\": [\r\n        {\r\n          \"@type\": \"dcat:Distribution\",\r\n          \"description\": \"Foods and Physical Activity in Public Elementary Schools, 2005 data in a zipped DAT file\",\r\n          \"downloadURL\": \"https://nces.ed.gov/surveys/frss/download/data/f87data.zip\",\r\n          \"format\": \"Zipped DAT\",\r\n          \"mediaType\": \"application/zip\",\r\n          \"title\": \"f87data.zip\"\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n          \"@type\": \"dcat:Distribution\",\r\n          \"description\": \"Foods and Physical Activity in Public Elementary Schools, 2005 data in a zipped SAS 