. Students in grade 4, 8, and 12 were sampled. NAEP 2006 assessments consist of national assessments in civics and U.S. history at grades 4, 8, and 12, and economics at grade 12. The study��s response rate was between 78 and 86 percent. Key statistics produced from NAEP 2006 are results on subject-matter achievement, instructional experiences, and school environment for populations of students (e.g., all fourth-graders) and groups within those populations (e.g., female students, Hispanic students).\",\r\n      \"keyword\": [ \"Students\", \"Civics\", \"U.S. history\", \"Economics\", \"National Assessment of Educational Progress\" ],\r\n      \"modified\": \"2008-02-20\",\r\n      \"publisher\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"org:Organization\",\r\n        \"name\": \"National Center for Education Statistics\",\r\n        \"subOrganizationOf\": {\r\n          \"@type\": \"org:Organization\",\r\n          \"name\": \"Institute of Education Sciences\",\r\n          \"subOrganizationOf\": {\r\n            \"@type\": \"org:Organization\",\r\n            \"name\": \"U.S. Department of Education\",\r\n            \"subOrganizationOf\": {\r\n              \"@type\": \"org:Organization\",\r\n              \"name\": \"U.S. Government\"\r\n            }\r\n          }\r\n        }\r\n      },\r\n      \"contactPoint\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"vcard:Contact\",\r\n        \"fn\": \"Linda Hamilton\",\r\n        \"hasEmail\": \"mailto:linda.hamilton@ed.gov\"\r\n      },\r\n      \"identifier\": \"NCES_2007475\",\r\n      \"accessLevel\": \"public\",\r\n      \"bureauCode\": [ \"018:50\" ],\r\n      \"programCode\": [ \"018:000\" ],\r\n      \"license\": \"https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/\",\r\n      \"spatial\": \"United States\",\r\n      \"temporal\": \"2005/2006\",\r\n      \"distribution\": [\r\n        {\r\n          \"@type\": \"dcat:Distribution\",\r\n          \"accessURL\": \"https://nces.ed.gov/nationsreportcard/naepdata/dataset.aspx\",\r\n          \"desc