onal experiences, and school environment for populations of students (e.g., all fourth-graders) and groups within those populations (e.g. female students, Hispanic students).\",\r\n      \"keyword\": [ \"Students\", \"Geography\", \"Civics\", \"U.S. History\", \"Assessment\", \"National Assessment of Educational Progress\" ],\r\n      \"modified\": \"2012-07-31\",\r\n      \"publisher\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"org:Organization\",\r\n        \"name\": \"National Center for Education Statistics\",\r\n        \"subOrganizationOf\": {\r\n          \"@type\": \"org:Organization\",\r\n          \"name\": \"Institute of Education Sciences\",\r\n          \"subOrganizationOf\": {\r\n            \"@type\": \"org:Organization\",\r\n            \"name\": \"U.S. Department of Education\",\r\n            \"subOrganizationOf\": {\r\n              \"@type\": \"org:Organization\",\r\n              \"name\": \"U.S. Government\"\r\n            }\r\n          }\r\n        }\r\n      },\r\n      \"contactPoint\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"vcard:Contact\",\r\n        \"fn\": \"Linda Hamilton\",\r\n        \"hasEmail\": \"mailto:linda.hamilton@ed.gov\"\r\n      },\r\n      \"identifier\": \"NCES_2011466\",\r\n      \"accessLevel\": \"public\",\r\n      \"bureauCode\": [ \"018:50\" ],\r\n      \"programCode\": [ \"018:000\" ],\r\n      \"license\": \"https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/\",\r\n      \"spatial\": \"United States\",\r\n      \"temporal\": \"2009/2010\",\r\n      \"distribution\": [\r\n        {\r\n          \"@type\": \"dcat:Distribution\",\r\n          \"accessURL\": \"https://nces.ed.gov/nationsreportcard/naepdata/dataset.aspx\",\r\n          \"description\": \"2010 National Assessment of Educational Progress data available through the NAEP Data Explorer\",\r\n          \"format\": \"API\",\r\n          \"title\": \"NAEP Data Explorer\"\r\n        }\r\n\r\n      ],\r\n      \"accrualPeriodicity\": \"R/P1Y\",\r\n      \"dataQuality\": true,\r\n      \"issue