eau of Indian Education-funded schools were sampled using paper-and-pencil assessment. Overall weighted response rate for 4th grade was 75 percent. Overall weighted response rate for 8th grade was 74 percent. Key statistics produced from NIES 2007 provides educators, policymakers, and the public with information about the academic performance in reading and mathematics of AI/AN fourth- and eighth-graders as well as their exposure to Native American culture.\",\r\n      \"keyword\": [ \"National Assessment of Education Progress, NAEP\", \"Indian education\", \"Native education\", \"NIES\", \"Focus groups\", \"Report\" ],\r\n      \"modified\": \"2009-02-13\",\r\n      \"publisher\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"org:Organization\",\r\n        \"name\": \"National Center for Education Statistics\",\r\n        \"subOrganizationOf\": {\r\n          \"@type\": \"org:Organization\",\r\n          \"name\": \"Institute of Education Sciences\",\r\n          \"subOrganizationOf\": {\r\n            \"@type\": \"org:Organization\",\r\n            \"name\": \"U.S. Department of Education\",\r\n            \"subOrganizationOf\": {\r\n              \"@type\": \"org:Organization\",\r\n              \"name\": \"U.S. Government\"\r\n            }\r\n          }\r\n        }\r\n      },\r\n      \"contactPoint\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"vcard:Contact\",\r\n        \"fn\": \"Linda Hamilton\",\r\n        \"hasEmail\": \"mailto:linda.hamilton@ed.gov\"\r\n      },\r\n      \"identifier\": \"NCES_2008457\",\r\n      \"accessLevel\": \"restricted public\",\r\n      \"bureauCode\": [ \"018:50\" ],\r\n      \"programCode\": [ \"018:000\" ],\r\n      \"license\": \"https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/\",\r\n      \"spatial\": \"United States\",\r\n      \"temporal\": \"2006/2007\",\r\n      \"distribution\": [\r\n        {\r\n          \"@type\": \"dcat:Distribution\",\r\n          \"accessURL\": \"https://nces.ed.gov/nationsreportcard/niesdata/\",\r\n          \"description\": \"2